# This repository is edited on both Windows and Unix machines. Without an
# explicit policy, Windows checkouts reintroduce CRLF, which makes gofmt
# report every .go file as unformatted.
#
# Store all text as LF in the repository, and check it out as LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
